    "publication_date": "2025-07-11",
    "description": "<p>This dataset supports the paper \"Dynamic Metal-Support Interaction Dictates Cu Nanoparticle Sintering on Al2O3 Surfaces\".</p>\n<p>The following files are provided:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The training and validation structures.</li>\n<li>The training input file.</li>\n<li>The VASP input files for single-point calculation and ab initio molecular dynamics.</li>\n<li>The global minimum configurations of Cu nanoparticles on three Al2O3 surfaces.</li>\n</ul>",
